flowchart TD
    NEED["a real-time need"] --> DIR{direction and state}
    DIR -->|bidirectional foreground| WS["WebSocket (Ch 63)"]
    DIR -->|one-way foreground stream| SSE["SSE: text/event-stream + Last-Event-ID"]
    DIR -->|one-way, SSE/WS unavailable or rare| LP["long polling: hold-open + cursor"]
    DIR -->|infrequent| SP["short polling"]
    DIR -->|background/killed| FCM["FCM (Ch 49)"]
    SSE --> MANAGE["reconnect+backoff (Ch 2) + resume (Last-Event-ID) + events->Flow"]
    LP --> MANAGE
    MANAGE --> MERGE["idempotent SSOT merge: dedup by event id, order by seq (Ch 3/15)"]
    MERGE --> UI["UI observes SSOT (Ch 6)"]
    REST["SSOT/REST = truth (Ch 32)"] -.->|drops self-heal| MERGE
    LIFECYCLE["foreground only - background disconnects + FCM (Ch 44/49)"] -.-> SSE
    LIFECYCLE -.-> LP
